OL,3,AStudents react to GCSE results as
OL,4,Aregional gap widens in England
OL,5,
OL,6,FNasser, who's fled the war in Sudan,
OL,7,Fsays passing his maths and English
OL,8,FGCSEs is one of his "proudest moments",
OL,9,Fbut not everyone getting their results
OL,10,Fis a teenager - with 56-year-old nurse
OL,11,FJoanne passing her maths exam
OL,13,FIn England, GCSEs are graded using a
OL,14,Fnumerical system from 9-1, while in
OL,15,FWales and Northern Ireland they are
OL,16,Fstill graded using letters from A* to U
OL,18,FOur team of experts have been answering
OL,19,Fyour questions - giving advice on
OL,20,Fthings like getting your paper remarked
OL,21,Fand if you don't have a plan yet
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
